>Paul writes:
>>Since there are no details on how to convert an altar in the spoilers,
>>I was resigned to do it myself.  I sacrificed a monster, and, lo and behold,
>>the altar was converted.  Being a Neutral Priest, I was happy.
>
>   Ummm..  actually, sacraficing on an altar of a differing alignment converts
>   YOU, not the altar...  unless you sacrafice a Unicorn of the alignment of
>   the altar (black unicorn for evil altar, white for good, grey for neutral)
>   if you sacrafice the appropriate unicorn, the altar will (may?) be converted
